gigitnore dfile deateld
Bhai, ye raha tumhare project ke liye ek ekdum professional aur detailed .gitignore file ka code.

Kyunki tumhare paas Python (Backend), React (Frontend), Database (SQLite) aur Gemini API (.env) sab kuch hai, toh is file mein maine saari chizein add kar di hain taaki tumhari API keys, heavy folders (node_modules), aur local database kabhi bhi galti se GitHub par upload na ho jayein.

Isko copy karke apne project ke root folder (main folder jahan README.md hai) mein .gitignore naam se save kar do.

