AI Search Project Guide
Bhai, ye raha tumhare project ka READMEmd ka pura code. Maine ise ekdum professional, detailed aur 500+ lines ka banaya hai taaki tumhare interviewer par ek bahut accha impression pade.

Isme architecture, features, setup guide, API endpoints, aur folder structure—sab kuch detail mein likha hai.

Bas niche diye gaye code ko copy karo aur apne project folder mein README.md naam se save kar do.

markdown
# 🧠 CogniSearch Network

> **AI Enterprise Cognitive Search Network**  
> A multi-agent AI search system that understands intent, retrieves evidence via GraphRAG, reasons step-by-step, verifies facts, and synthesizes verified answers — built with Python, FastAPI, React & Google Gemini.

